# AccelSim/GPGPU-Sim override fragment for an A100 80GB HBM2e-style 5-stack run.
#
# This keeps the stock SM80_A100 108-SM / 40-memory-partition geometry explicit.
# The Ramulator2 side should use configs/ramulator/a100_hbm2e_5stack.yaml or a
# matching 40-channel ExternalChannelRoBaRaCoCh config.
#
# Address mapping note:
# - gpgpu_memory_partition_indexing 2 (IPoly) is supported for 40 channels by
#   hashing channels in the next power-of-two domain and folding back to 40.
# - Use this balanced mapping for 5-stack/40-channel runs unless intentionally
#   comparing against the stock consecutive mapping.

-gpgpu_n_clusters 108
-gpgpu_n_mem 40
-gpgpu_n_sub_partition_per_mchannel 4
-gpgpu_memory_partition_indexing 2
-gpgpu_mem_address_mask 1
-gpgpu_mem_addr_mapping dramid@8;00000000.00000000.00000000.00000000.0000RRRR.RRRRRRRR.RBBBCCCC.BCCSSSSS
